{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_002_1000_p", "source_sha256": "9146a1199e69b670db0f028430b59de8246dd321b01bb341fccbc92fd8169997", "ja": "（宣材写真を撮影するために、\n星梨花と一緒に撮影スタジオにやってきた）", "zh": "（为了拍摄宣传照，\n我和星梨花一起来到了摄影棚。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_002_1001_022ser", "source_sha256": "a5b2892114b6b797fab9a6fc35dfacb4f751ce16d0956ec2c11b0eab2b5245e0", "ja": "わぁ～！　初めて見る機械がいっぱい……。", "zh": "哇～！好多第一次看到的机器喔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_002_1002_022ser", "source_sha256": "d5a7b681e5abc193aae788a5077778de9ac1e143a4e5e36588584ea7374896ac", "ja": "アイドルの人達は、みんな、ここで写真を\n撮ってもらってるんですか？　すごいなぁ……。", "zh": "偶像们都是在这里拍照的吗？\n好厉害喔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_002_1003_p", "source_sha256": "c669afcc4022d1c28ef43f134b813465bc7127b36260fd28a0de7424b8e10c6b", "ja": "そうだな。\n765プロのみんなは、ここで撮ってるよ。", "zh": "是啊。\n在765艺能，大家都是在这里拍的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_002_1004_022ser", "source_sha256": "5626e2cddb6f193e1ba18e7ac34bf6ecf1070a8c6ec40c665db1e1f25bec15c2", "ja": "今日はわたしも、ここで宣材写真の撮影を\nするんですよね？　えへへ、楽しみです！", "zh": "今天我也要在这边拍宣传照对吧？\n嘿嘿，我好期待！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_002_1005_022ser", "source_sha256": "c96d4096e7a02c3d7ddc7fa12a12d8bb8ba4975c4ec5cd2a511d0de9e1f1f25a", "ja": "でも、宣材写真……ってなんですか？\nもしかして、業界用語？？", "zh": "可是，宣传照……是什么啊？\n该不会是业界用语吧？？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_002_1006_p", "source_sha256": "dc163338e82c8788d6123dc06ef6d621538fd3b5fc5c11d85710b03326df1542", "ja": "宣材写真っていうのは、星梨花がアイドルの仕事を\nもらえるように、宣伝するための写真なんだ。", "zh": "所谓的宣传照，是为了让星梨花能接到偶像的工作，\n而用来宣传的照片。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_002_1007_p", "source_sha256": "53ec5d61fde143b5a0b3ad8cc7cb7a781cbb466a31f7ccd063f1dad9c9080bd1", "ja": "ようするに、星梨花を色々な人に\nアピールする写真ってことかな。", "zh": "简单来说，就是把星梨花的魅力\n表现给各式各样的人欣赏的照片。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_002_1008_022ser", "source_sha256": "66f94f328a9d4804e392c7445c3d726e2ea06bffcc50aff6df57bfc372349342", "ja": "アピールですか……。", "zh": "表现魅力吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_002_1009_022ser", "source_sha256": "d5af29f98c442e069305e0e09a8399ae7779144dcd85f92922b7709c35838957", "ja": "プロデューサーさん。\nどうすれば、みなさんにアピールできるんでしょうか？", "zh": "制作人先生，\n要怎么做才能向大家表现魅力呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_002_1010_p", "source_sha256": "b901ff9e44d38f9323fe1e940358fc402f4de111694ca80f079412a615428a81", "ja": "星梨花にしかない個性みたいなものが、\n感じられるといいかもしれないね。", "zh": "要是能让人感受到\n星梨花独有的特质，应该会是个好方法。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_002_1011_022ser", "source_sha256": "cfedbe028e9b3738920a247b39183ee57c378971d14b8c6f2fbe52fcee3bb0bf", "ja": "個性ですね、わかりました！\n……あれ？　でも、わたしの個性ってなんだろう……？", "zh": "特质吗，我知道了！\n……咦？但我有什么样的特质呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_002_1012_p", "source_sha256": "c248de05070018659faf3e472c7426a2652de1aaa1baff6b4062954800c8e25e", "ja": "そうだな……。\n星梨花は、何か好きなことってあるのか？", "zh": "我想想……\n星梨花喜欢哪些事呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_002_1013_022ser", "source_sha256": "5dab89f2224c9f2a97b8fa3f00f166c0eb6a0f4198a42b46d2e7664d5ddeb3df", "ja": "いっぱいありますよ！　お友達とお喋りしたり、\nヴァイオリンを弾いてるときは楽しいです！", "zh": "有很多喔！\n像是和朋友聊天、拉小提琴时，我都很开心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_002_1014_022ser", "source_sha256": "51a51409f2890ae43d6ba13f755cef54aedafa95d4b084060cb82c61669ca746", "ja": "でも、一番好きなのは、\nパパとママとジュニオールと一緒にいることです！", "zh": "可是我最喜欢的，\n还是和爸爸妈妈跟朱尼奥尔在一起的时候！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_002_1015_p", "source_sha256": "4cec592d7d159acb2335487237d77088881eef9e086f7baf125774040844cc93", "ja": "ジュニオール？", "zh": "朱尼奥尔？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_002_1016_022ser", "source_sha256": "ecd6c218278e851b2d687ac92aa64f5a9a52d1e3a37f75af26e0e84577fcb267", "ja": "あっ、ジュニオールはわたしの家で飼ってる\n犬の名前です！　とっても賢くていい子なんですよ！", "zh": "啊，朱尼奥尔是我家养的狗！\n牠是很聪明的好孩子喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_002_1017_022ser", "source_sha256": "4dbb53eee3f0cc7c1cdbea1fa7edee70a1fdefd7d909d7044b23cec82a400eda", "ja": "この前も、パパとママとジュニオールと一緒に、\n大きな公園までお出かけしてきたんです。", "zh": "前阵子我还和爸爸妈妈跟朱尼奥尔\n一起去了很大的公园。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_002_1018_p", "source_sha256": "bdff32c4b837fa024d34e229f1ab89b8189dfef15edf5d4819da23945cbd16e5", "ja": "へぇ、そうだったのか。\n楽しかった？", "zh": "哦，是这样啊。\n好玩吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_002_1019_022ser", "source_sha256": "ce1c02d0c88325353acf6b365419f5e42667bcfcbc8bb353345610c1b3ac5948", "ja": "はい、とっても！　ジュニオールと追いかけっこして、\nみんなでママのお弁当を食べて……えへへ♪", "zh": "嗯，非常好玩！我和朱尼奥尔玩了你追我跑，\n大家还一起吃妈妈准备的便当……嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_002_1020_p", "source_sha256": "674498b6918c0db3f259f0a30f414e56efeccd5104119fe3429c83369c466635", "ja": "星梨花は、家族のみんなが大好きなんだな。\n今、すごくいい笑顔をしてるよ！", "zh": "看来星梨花很喜欢家人呢。\n你现在的笑容很棒喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_002_1021_022ser", "source_sha256": "1c57c936e2c1ce363851476f8b9836bfe37c891665cc5de772c0b18c435a9dd0", "ja": "はい！　パパもママもジュニオールも、\nみ～んな大好きです♪", "zh": "嗯！爸爸妈妈跟朱尼奥尔，\n都是我的最爱♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_002_1022_p", "source_sha256": "8d33ecd0934fa6d58ba949ce06e2504ce8077475eb579003f62100f8db40dfdf", "ja": "星梨花の個性は、その好きなものを好きって\n正直に言える、素直なところじゃないかな。", "zh": "星梨花的特质，就是「对喜欢的东西会直接说喜欢」\n的坦率个性吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_002_1023_022ser", "source_sha256": "b25b52a16d0fd0b836b1fae88916445c299702d47cd2c52767b2d4a848c62c42", "ja": "素直なところ……。", "zh": "坦率个性……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_002_1024_p", "source_sha256": "e58eba1e408fb8a5d4f27ebe86517ff89c1d3770c5797319590f9cda469d6d91", "ja": "ああ。だから撮影でも、今みたいに\n素直な気持ちで臨めば大丈夫だ！", "zh": "是呀。所以你拍照时，\n只要用刚才那种坦率的心情去拍就行了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_002_1025_022ser", "source_sha256": "b83f28bf4ca3d16c4a612cf6179b71f303bdbddfac14c02dd87188bd7bed4cae", "ja": "そうなんですか？　わかりました！\n素直に、ですね！", "zh": "是这样吗？我知道了！\n要坦率对吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_002_1026_p", "source_sha256": "56d50833455a529bbc3da271abf6a4b3dcebff8751c47103561fd02e332ed45f", "ja": "その調子だ！\nほら、そろそろ星梨花の順番みたいだぞ。", "zh": "就是这种感觉！\n好啦，好像差不多轮到星梨花了喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_002_1027_022ser", "source_sha256": "84511381b27f872e5157ee9807dff492d3f0bbd475b649a873386e2dd3664397", "ja": "{$P$}さん、行ってきます！\nわたし、頑張ります♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生，我这就过去！\n我会加油的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_022ser_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_022ser_002_1028_p", "source_sha256": "9390bc48f9ef137803cdd1e0fa1d6ddcd56856e5ec6c745f2c688f503a279e16", "ja": "（星梨花の素直な笑顔は、やっぱり魅力的だな。\nこれなら、きっと撮影もうまくいくぞ！）", "zh": "（星梨花坦率的笑容，果然很有魅力呢。\n这样看来，拍照一定会很顺利吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
